note bottom of AlertDetailPanel
  Panel over the inbox, which stays as it was: origin, value and limit, timeline
  and related actions. Operators and quality managers register the attention and
  the resolution, auditors and a resolved alert only read. panel=resolve starts on
  the corrective action; closing goes back to where the person came from.
  "View conditions" -> /tracking/history?environmentId=&deviceId=.
end note
note bottom of AlertDashboard
  Inbox of the open alerts (active=true) of every environment, or of the one in
  ?environmentId=; the most urgent first. It refreshes every 30 s while the tab is
  visible; an environment that fails is named without hiding the others. Attention
  can be undone for 5 s: nothing reaches the platform until the toast ends, the person
  moves on, signs out or leaves the page. J and K move through the list and A attends.
  The history lists every alert with filters, under the same page header.
end note


